Package: latitude-e7440-platform-driver
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd, acpid, lm-sensors, fancontrol, nut-server, nut-client
Replaces: linux-battery-nut-bridge
Conflicts: linux-battery-nut-bridge
Description: Handles lid switch, brightness, and power removal for Dell Latitude e7440.
 Provides sandboxed acpid systemd oneshots and scripts to manage turning off
 the backlight when the lid is closed and turning it on when the lid is
 opened, adjusting the brightness using the function keys, and dimming the
 screen when the power cord is unplugged.
